<mxCell id="s308" value="Draft / Returned items past D are treated as terminal (shown as Expired, not stored); a budget becomes Closed when every item is&lt;br&gt;NOT_SPONSORED, Paid, Reconciled, Rejected or expired. Duplicate payments are blocked by the paidAt check and the __v revision guard." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#90A4AE;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#263238;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="5984" width="932.8" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
